{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 29, :comments ["<b>Watch:</b> The word ha-shoked is defective, and it is as in 'I am watchful over My word' and 'to watch at My doors.' The sense: watch over them, and they are the silver and the gold." "<b>The chambers of the house of YHWH:</b> The sense is the officers of the chambers of the house of YHWH, and the heh of knowledge has entered, on the pattern of הלשכות, and the word is transformed because of the construct state."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {1 "'ה\"א הדעת' rendered literally as 'the heh of knowledge'; the term is Ibn Ezra's standard designation for the definite-article prefix heh, but is kept literal per voice rules."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:42:20.179403595Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}